            <ArticleTitle>Taking the mystery out of endodontics, Part 6. Painless anesthesia for the &quot;hot&quot; tooth.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>90-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Much of what we were taught in dental school is no longer valid. In this article, I've examined some of the myths surrounding what I have dubbed the &quot;inferior&quot; inferior alveolar nerve block. Using the X-tip anesthesia system, it is now possible to achieve total, instant and profound anesthesia of the &quot;hot&quot; tooth, without the problems formerly associated with intraosseous injections.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
